WEBVTT

00:07:29.364 --> 00:07:31.301
But we do have to be frank --

00:07:31.325 --> 00:07:34.075
women do get pitted against other women

00:07:34.099 --> 00:07:36.987
for the limited number
of seats at the table.

00:07:37.011 --> 00:07:41.853
We have to be wary of having
our solidarity with each other eroded

00:07:41.877 --> 00:07:44.320
by these politics of scarcity.

00:07:44.344 --> 00:07:47.869
Instead, we should work together
to change the rules

00:07:47.893 --> 00:07:49.837
that keep us at the margins.

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:54.027
NOI: So to summarize,
our standout lessons are ...

00:07:54.051 --> 00:07:57.417
Number one, there's no right way
to be a woman leader.

00:07:57.441 --> 00:07:59.063
Be true to yourself.

00:07:59.376 --> 00:08:00.526
JG: Number two,